# A Busy Evening: a showcase of indoor round 2 (docs/VIDEO_GENERATION.md, "What is done at home"). Pip's birthday tea in the kitchen - the kettle, the cake, confetti and a
# dance - the cat's mischief in the living room, bath time upstairs, and a stormy night: the lights flicker and go out, a torch, and shadow play on the bedroom wall.
# The house faces the camera (its front wall towards -z): the living room on the left (pbrt x 2.1), the kitchen on the right (pbrt x -2.5); upstairs the bathroom over the
# living room (and the stairs), the bedroom over the kitchen.
film    a-busy-evening
name    A Busy Evening
about   Pip's birthday tea, the cat's mischief, bath time and a stormy night at home.
scene   film_assets/stage/set.pbrt
length  72
tags    cartoon, indoors, showcase

toon     bands 3  lines 2
sky      18:30 23:00  south 0
exposure auto
weather  rain 0.7 from 54 to 72
lightning 5 during 56 64

house    home at 0 0 rooms living kitchen upstairs bathroom bedroom  style cosy
walls    home.living wallpaper stripes colour 0.82 0.74 0.6 colour 0.7 0.6 0.48
walls    home.kitchen paint 0.86 0.9 0.82
floor    home.kitchen checks
walls    home.bedroom wallpaper roses colour 0.86 0.8 0.82
walls    home.bathroom wallpaper tiles
clutter  home.kitchen tidy
furnish  home.bedroom candles

party    home.kitchen birthday
cook     home.kitchen kettle at 1
cook     home.kitchen meal at 0 until 30
confetti home.kitchen at 9.5
dance    home.kitchen at 10.5 until 20

cast pip   at 0.9 0 0.3  facing -90
cast nova  at -3.4 0 -1.2  facing 0
character mittens cat at 2.6 0 -0.6  facing 0
character biscuit dog at -1.3 0 -1.4  facing 0
guests   home.kitchen 2

say      nova 2.5 "Happy birthday, Pip!"
blowout  pip at 2
say      pip 9 "Yay!"

thing    vase1 vase on coffeetable
nap      mittens on sofa at 0 until 19
knock    mittens vase1 at 20
nap      mittens on sofa at 24.3 until 72
walk     pip 26 0.9 to 2.1 -0.82 to 3.0 -0.82
say      pip 32.5 "Mittens!"
heel     biscuit pip at 28

go       pip to home.bedroom at 34 speed 1.3
bath     home.bathroom at 40 until 53
go       pip to home.bathroom at 45 speed 1.2
go       pip to home.bedroom at 54 speed 1.2
say      pip 50.5 "Bath time!"

flicker  home.bedroom at 56 until 61
powercut 61 until 72
torch    pip at 61.5 until 65.5
say      pip 62 "Who turned off the lights?"
shadowplay pip animal wolf at 65.5 until 72

shot 0 Birthday tea
  key   -1.0 1.6 -1.75   -3.0 0.9 0.4   62
shot 9 Confetti
  key   -0.9 1.9 -1.7   -2.8 0.8 0.6   66
shot 20 Mittens
  key   2.6 2.0 -1.85   2.0 0.15 -0.35   74
shot 34 Up to bed
  trail pip
shot 45 Bath time
  key   0.8 4.3 -1.6   2.4 3.3 1.0   62
shot 56 The storm
  key   -1.2 4.3 -1.6   -3.0 3.4 0.8   62
shot 64.5 Shadows
  key   -1.0 4.0 0.9   -3.4 3.6 -2.0   66
shot 69 Good night
  key   0 3.6 -9   0 2.4 0   40
  cutaway
